<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $926,250 women's German Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat 2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) 6-3 6-1  </p>
<p>12-Mary Pierce (France) beat 7-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
